    "backstory": "Born from the muck of Subchain City, Wrencher started as a simple scavenger searching for scraps. After stumbling upon an abandoned cache of tech, he quickly became the fix-it duck for his local flock, jury-rigging defenses and keeping their antiquated gear operational.",
